### 1. Create a Task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot 3",
  "subject": "Java",
  "description": "Complete REST API endpoints and tests",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-15"
}

### 2. Get All Tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### 3. Get Task by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1

### 4. Filter Tasks by Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=IN_PROGRESS

### 5. Filter Tasks by Priority and Subject
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?priority=HIGH&subject=Java

### 6. Mark Task as Complete
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/complete

### 7. Update Task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Master Spring Boot 3",
  "subject": "Java",
  "description": "All endpoints tested and verified",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-25"
}

### 8. Get Tasks Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/summary

### 9. Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
